#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:372
msgid ""
"<p>Some of the images could not be analyzed with the current settings or they do not contain any red-eyes at all.</p>"
"<p><b>Would you like to remove those images from the list?</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>En Reeg Biller laat sik mit de aktuellen Instellen nich bekieken, oder se bargt gor keen root Ogen.</p>"
"<p><b>Wullt Du disse Biller vun de List wegmaken?</b></p>"

#. +> trunk
#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:378
msgid "Remove unprocessed images?"
msgstr "Nich afarbeidt Biller wegmaken?"

#. +> trunk
#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:404
msgid ""
"<p>You tried to add <b>RAW images</b> to the plugin,<br/>"
"but those filetypes are not supported.</p>"
"<p><b>They were automatically removed from the list.</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du wullt <b>Rohbiller</b> na't Moduul övergeven,<br/>"
" man dat gifft keen Ünnerstütten för disse Dateitypen.</p>"
"<p><b>Se wöörn automaatsch vun de List wegmaakt.</b></p>"

